<linker>
  <!--
    MessagePack 3.1.8 marks its assembly as trimmable, so ILLink analyzes dynamic fallback
    resolvers even when the application never roots them. AnimaSeek supplies only closed generic,
    hand-written, built-in, and source-generated formatters through SeekerMessagePackResolver.
    The suppressed diagnostics all originate inside the package's unused reflection/Emit fallback
    implementation. These attributes are intentionally assembly-scoped because the package source
    is external; keep the warning-ID list explicit so a new diagnostic category still fails the build.
  -->
